          <groundspeak:finder id="836983">Coolcat21</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP638 - Glendon

Posted: N54° 15.029' W111° 09.240'

(FOUND)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After parking nearby I made my way over to ground zero to find...a cap in a miniature lake. Would you believe, deep-ish hole chock full of water?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now I'm thinking I need to add a wet / dry shop vac and a very, very long extension cord to my arsenal of capping tools. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the end I TOUCHED this cap in its watery container hole but I didn't ever actually see it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="636509742">
